on-member, and how its own candidacy is suppressed, is source-derived.\\\",\n    \\\"The candidate's identity was supplied by the probe rather than produced by a real node's election, so the request is a legal message rather than a real campaign.\\\"\n   ]}\n ]\n}\njson.dump(u,open('update.json','w'),indent=2); print('written')\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-15_18-00-28-hashicorp_raft-real-run --submission update.json 2>&1 | tail -2\"","aggregated_output":"written\n{\"valid\": true, \"run_id\": \"1bdd60fe5af14a33879d92997922e21b\", \"elapsed_seconds\": 1978.2659741810057, \"diagnostics\": [], \"meaning\": \"Read-only validation of these bytes and saved state; no acceptance, execution or budget reservation\", \"no_change\": false, \"execution_requested\": false, \"effects\": [{\"object\": \"interpretations\", \"action\": \"append\", \"target\": \"interpretations[0]\", \"investigation_id\": \"680bc27c9c50448a8b63097d98091061-question-0\", \"changed_fields\": [\"experiment_id\", \"source_ids\", \"executions\", \"conclusion\", \"rationale\", \"counterevidence\", \"limitations\", \"joint_history\"]}, {\"object\": \"interpretations\", \"action\": \"append\", \"target\": \"interpretations[1]\", \"investigation_id\": \"7e10640e7212486b94a80f04b69febc2-question-1\", \"changed_fields\": [\"source_ids\", \"executions\", \"rationale\", \"counterevidence\", \"limitations\", \"joint_history\"]}]}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
